# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, Git checks the same file out as CRLF on Windows and LF on Linux.
# That is usually harmless, but this project hashes several source files to
# detect whether the model changed between runs, and the raw bytes differed
# between a local run and CI even though the repository content was identical.
# The hash normalises newlines itself, so this is belt-and-braces — but keeping
# the working tree consistent removes the whole class of surprise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and compressed payloads must never be touched.
*.json.gz binary
*.csv.gz  binary
*.png     binary
*.ico     binary
